<!--5D3612FEEE2F4F2480BDBB17DCA34279-->  <DESCRIPTION><![CDATA[Moves this tenant to another plan, as an assisted plan change]]></DESCRIPTION>
<!--5D3612FEEE2F4F2480BDBB17DCA34279-->  <HELP><![CDATA[Operator plan change (ETP-5053). Applies exactly what the customer could do from the account page: a change the Allowed Plan Changes tab offers from the current plan, an upgrade now (prorated, the billing date unchanged, the quota year kept) or a downgrade scheduled at the end of the current billing period (recorded in Pending Plan / Pending Effective Date). Refused with a message for a transition no row allows, a subscription that is not current, a plan with no provider price, or a closed row.]]></HELP>
